  "details": "I am having constant crashes with VRC with DiscordHook64 being the faul code I keep getting. I have attached a screenshot of the report in Windows Reliability, and have plenty more of these screenshots for different times this occurred, all showing DiscordHook64 as the fault code. This has been an on going problem for 2 weeks and I have tried multiple fixes that don't do anything. I believe this is the EAC confusing DiscordHook with malicious software and therefore crashing the game.\n\nI have tested all of my hardware and have found no faults or defects\n\nI have performed a clean install of both Discord and VRChat\n\nI have attempted to force Discord to stop connecting to VRChat, unfortunately, all of these are reconnected once I open VR again and Discord detects it. This is not something to my knowledge I can permanently disable. I have noticed if I do not run Discord at all, as in force ending the task in task manager, the crashes stop happening.",
